    "en": {
      "trackName": "Partywheel - Quick Party Games",
      "description": "Elevate Your Game Nights!\nIntroducing \"Partywheel\" the ultimate party companion that guarantees a night full of laughter, challenges, and unforgettable moments. Perfect for house parties and social events, our interactive wheel brings a fresh twist to your traditional games.\n\n== Features:\nSpin to Win\nSimply spin the wheel and let fate decide your next move. Each spin is a new adventure.\n\nInteractive Challenges\nFrom mimicking dance moves in \"Swing\" to answering truth-or-dare questions, our game keeps everyone on their toes.\n\nEasy to Play\nNo complicated rules or setups. Just gather your friends, spin the wheel, and let the games begin!\n\n== How to Play:\nGather your friends and open the app.\nTake turns spinning the wheel.\nFollow the action or challenge indicated by the slice.\nKeep spinning until you decide to call it a night!",
      "releaseNotes": "A complete makeover, have fun!",
